    <fields>
        <fullName>Core_Goal_Criteria__c</fullName>
        <inlineHelpText>The criteria which should be met to achieve the goal. This is a systemically pre-populated field based on KPI selected.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Criteria</label>
        <required>true</required>
        <trackHistory>true</trackHistory>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
        <type>Picklist</type>
        <valueSet>
            <controllingField>Core_Goal_BU_Focus_Area__c</controllingField>
            <restricted>true</restricted>
            <valueSetDefinition>
                <sorted>false</sorted>
                <value>
                    <fullName>New</fullName>
                    <default>false</default>
                    <label>New</label>
                </value>
                <value>
                    <fullName>Example</fullName>
                    <default>false</default>
                    <label>Example</label>
                </value>
                <value>
                    <fullName>Win must include at least 25 clients within a user group who use Authenticate regularly for at least 2 weeks. IT uses a process to inteall Authenticate on the customer&apos;s production IT image, applies policy management and uses 2 or more factors.</fullName>
                    <default>false</default>
                    <label>Win must include at least 25 clients within a user group who use Authenticate regularly for at least 2 weeks. IT uses a process to inteall Authenticate on the customer&apos;s production IT image, applies policy management and uses 2 or more factors.</label>
                </value>
                <value>
                    <fullName>Win must include at least 25 clients within a user group who use Intel Data Guard regularly for at least 2 weeks, IT uses a process to install Intel Data Guard on the customer&apos;s production IT image, uses their own KMS AND applies policy management. E</fullName>
                    <default>false</default>
                    <label>Win must include at least 25 clients within a user group who use Intel Data Guard regularly for at least 2 weeks, IT uses a process to install Intel Data Guard on the customer&apos;s production IT image, uses their own KMS AND applies policy management. E</label>
                </value>
                <value>
                    <fullName>Drive  Financial Services Industry players to adopt AI-based Saffron technology for use in identifying financial crimes, customer personalization and portfolio management. Eligible products include V10, and V11; Sledgehammer.</fullName>
                    <default>false</default>
                    <label>Drive  Financial Services Industry players to adopt AI-based Saffron technology for use in identifying financial crimes, customer personalization and portfolio management. Eligible products include V10, and V11; Sledgehammer.</label>
                </value>
                <value>
                    <fullName>Drive Government players to adopt AI-based Saffron technology for use in security monitoring and risk identification. Eligible products include V10, and V11; Sledgehammer.</fullName>
                    <default>false</default>
                    <label>Drive Government players to adopt AI-based Saffron technology for use in security monitoring and risk identification. Eligible products include V10, and V11; Sledgehammer.</label>
                </value>
                <value>
                    <fullName>Drive Manufacturing players to adopt AI-based Saffron technology for use in issue and defect triage, expertise and resolution. Eligible products include V10, and V11; Sledgehammer.</fullName>
                    <default>false</default>
                    <label>Drive Manufacturing players to adopt AI-based Saffron technology for use in issue and defect triage, expertise and resolution. Eligible products include V10, and V11; Sledgehammer.</label>
                </value>
                <value>
                    <fullName>Drive 3D NAND adoption in the data center. Minimum opportunity size must contain at least 50 SSDs. The following products are eligible: S3520, S4X00, D4X00P31XX, P3520, D3XX</fullName>
                    <default>false</default>
                    <label>Drive 3D NAND adoption in the data center. Minimum opportunity size must contain at least 50 SSDs. The following products are eligible: S3520, S4X00, D4X00P31XX, P3520, D3XX</label>
                </value>
                <value>
                    <fullName>Drive Optane SSD apoption both in data center and in client. Minimum 40 SSDs per Data Center Win and 100 SSDs per Client win. Includes the following eligible products.</fullName>
                    <default>false</default>
                    <label>Drive Optane SSD apoption both in data center and in client. Minimum 40 SSDs per Data Center Win and 100 SSDs per Client win. Includes the following eligible products.</label>
                </value>
                <value>
                    <fullName>This Solution Area focuses on attaching RTU/RCU sensors with GWs and/or Edge Servers to extract data to drive new levels of productivity in brownfield installations of manufacturing equipment. This includes any solution that combines Intel ingredient</fullName>
                    <default>false</default>
                    <label>This Solution Area focuses on attaching RTU/RCU sensors with GWs and/or Edge Servers to extract data to drive new levels of productivity in brownfield installations of manufacturing equipment. This includes any solution that combines Intel ingredient</label>
                </value>
                <value>
                    <fullName>Intel Responsive Retail Sensor Platform is an end-to-end retail analytics-based solution designed to help ecosystem solution providers and retailers create and deploy innovative retail solutions. Components include</fullName>
                    <default>false</default>
                    <label>Intel Responsive Retail Sensor Platform is an end-to-end retail analytics-based solution designed to help ecosystem solution providers and retailers create and deploy innovative retail solutions. Components include</label>
                </value>
                <value>
                    <fullName>Drive adoption of Intel-based digital signage systems.  Eligible products include:  Intel Core based Retail Signage solutions, Interactive Whiteboards, Public and Private Kiosks, Self-Service Kiosks, Digital Menus, etc.</fullName>
