                <controllingFieldValue>CCG: Authenticate</controllingFieldValue>
                <valueName>Win must include at least 25 clients within a user group who use Authenticate regularly for at least 2 weeks. IT uses a process to inteall Authenticate on the customer&apos;s production IT image, applies policy management and uses 2 or more factors.</valueName>
            </valueSettings>
            <valueSettings>
                <controllingFieldValue>CCG: Data Guard</controllingFieldValue>
                <valueName>Win must include at least 25 clients within a user group who use Intel Data Guard regularly for at least 2 weeks, IT uses a process to install Intel Data Guard on the customer&apos;s production IT image, uses their own KMS AND applies policy management. E</valueName>
